{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"setLanguage:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"language","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The language code (e.g., “en”, “de”, “fr”, “es”) or nil to reset to device language","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"language"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Override the device language for Pushwoosh to enable:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sending notifications in a specific language"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Language-based segmentation","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Supporting in-app language switching"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Must be a lowercase two-letter code according to ISO-639-1 standard."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Support in-app language selection:"}]},{"code":["class LanguageManager {","","    static let shared = LanguageManager()","","    var currentLanguage: String {","        didSet {","            applyLanguageChange()","        }","    }","","    func applyLanguageChange() {","        \/\/ Update Pushwoosh language for targeted notifications","        Pushwoosh.configure.setLanguage(currentLanguage)","","        \/\/ Update user tags","        P